"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:0972-07-01:0":{"b": ["Hasan el-A'sam avamia Remle tena na kushinda jeshi lenye nguvu la Fatimid", "c3b5ad80"], "d": ["Kiongozi wa Kikarmatî Hasan el-A'sam, Ramazan 361 (Julai 972), alivamia Remle tena na kushinda jeshi lenye nguvu la Fatimid; mwaka mmoja baadaye alishambulia Misri kwa nchi kavu na baharini na kuzingira Kairo tena lakini alishindwa na Azîz-Billâh.", "f629e2e1"]},
